  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Depression in freezing point is given as <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#916;T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math></p><p>Molality of solution <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>&#916;T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></msub></mfrac></math></p><p>or&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>86</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>322</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math></p><p>Elevation in boiling point of solution is given as</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#916;T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></msub><mo>&#215;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#916;T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>512</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>322</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#916;T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>165</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo></math> Boiling point of solution <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>373</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>16</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>373</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math></p>"
